Embedded assets
---------------

- assets/tabler-sprite.svg -- Tabler Icons, @tabler/icons-sprite 3.46.0, MIT.
- assets/images/angular-logo.svg -- Angular wordmark and shield. Angular is a
  trademark of Google LLC; the logo is used as-is for demonstration/attribution
  only and is not part of this package's licensed source. See
  https://angular.dev/press-kit for the Angular brand guidelines.
- assets/images/decaf-*.svg, assets/images/favicon*.svg, assets/icons/*,
  assets/i18n/*.json, assets/theme/*.scss -- original Decaf-TS project assets,
  covered by LICENSE.md.
- diagrams/assets/theme/*.scss -- original Decaf-TS theme sources, covered by
  LICENSE.md.

Demo-only fixtures are not part of the published package. In particular, the
AI-generated C2PA sample image kept at src/assets/images/ew/product.txt is
excluded from dist/lib and is not redistributed in the npm tarball.
